WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.371 --> 00:00:02.421
- Are you doing okay?

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.803
- No one knew I was police until today.

00:00:07.811 --> 00:00:08.700
Police!

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.041
- You're a pig living here with us?

00:00:11.041 --> 00:00:11.874
(dramatic music)

00:00:11.874 --> 00:00:14.220
- Had you ever seen the victim before?

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.212
- No.

00:00:15.212 --> 00:00:16.795
Get back! Get back!

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:19.077
(explosion)

00:00:19.077 --> 00:00:21.573
- Wallander, don't skip the counseling.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.890
- I should have been there, man.

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:28.310
- I'm not cut out for this.

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:29.810
- I want Wallander on the case.

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:30.990
He lives here.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:32.440
He has connections here.

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:33.710
- It's time to ask yourself

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:35.890
how much you want to be a detective.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:37.420
- I think I've got something.

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:39.570
Hugo's murder was carefully choreographed

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:40.670
to look a certain way,

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:45.120
to escalate the immigration conflict.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:48.040
(crowd roars)

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:49.310
- You're brave, coming back.

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:50.770
- This came from the outside.

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:52.840
Help me find who it was.

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:54.540
- The Hugo Lundgren grenade

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:55.550
flipped a switch on a case

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:58.450
that intelligence had
been building for months.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.970
- He's been smuggling
weapons into Malmo for years.

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:05.068
- Going after him is what's
known as a career ender.

00:01:05.068 --> 00:01:08.680
(camera shutter clicking)

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:10.650
- Do you know something about him?

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:11.700
- All that money and privilege,

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:13.691
it messes with your head.

00:01:13.691 --> 00:01:14.524
- What are you hiding?

00:01:14.524 --> 00:01:16.100
- This gentleman was just leaving.

00:01:17.321 --> 00:01:19.800
(explosion)

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:23.527
- Cases like this will take
everything that you have.

00:01:24.593 --> 00:01:26.563
- This job's full of tough choices.

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:32.563
- Why didn't you tell me the truth?

00:01:32.563 --> 00:01:34.029
- I wanted to protect you.

00:01:34.029 --> 00:01:34.862
(man grunting)

00:01:34.862 --> 00:01:38.000
I swear to you, I'm going
to find the man responsible.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.050
You will see justice.

00:01:41.890 --> 00:01:42.940
- Welcome to the job.

